      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really don't want to deal with the er right now if i don't have to. it's so expensive and honestly just so much stress. since the symptoms are 100% gone and i feel completely fine and normal again, isn't it possible it was just a temporary thing like eye strain or just getting older? i'd much rather just rest up and see how i feel in the morning before making a big scene at the hospital.",
